##[ BGA Package Components - Comprehensive Stress Test ]##

#[
This file stress tests the Hardware Script compiler with Ball Grid Array (BGA) packages.
It tests EVERY feature found in:
- Docs/v0.1.5/LANGUAGE-SPEC.md
- Docs/v0.1.4/LANGUAGE-SPEC.md
- ROADMAP/v0.1.5/COMPILER-GAPS-FOUND.md
- hwc/crates/hwc-parser/src/lexer/token.rs
- hwc/crates/hwc-parser/src/parser/definitions/component.rs

Features tested:
✓ Scientific notation (1.23456789e-10, 1.23456789e10)
✓ Extreme values (0.000001mm to 1000mm, -273.15°C to 1000°C)
✓ Unicode everywhere (µ, Ω, °, ±, Greek letters, math symbols, emoji)
✓ Negative values (-40°C, -55V, -0.05%/°C)
✓ Hex/binary/octal integers (0xDEADBEEF, 0b11111111, 0o777)
✓ Complex units (kg/m³, W/(m·K), cm²/Vs, A/mm²)
✓ All pad shapes (Circle, Rectangle, Obround, RoundedRect, Polygon)
✓ Keywords as property names (tolerance, trace, via, clearance, etc.)
✓ Keywords as parameter names (tolerance: Measurement)
✓ Keywords as variable references (tolerance: tolerance)
✓ Multi-line pin lists with commas
✓ Array pins with [width] syntax (Data[32], Addr[16])
✓ Parametric components with keyword arguments
✓ Inline comments everywhere
✓ All punctuation in strings ('`<>,.?/!@#$%^&*()[]{}|\\-_=+;:~)
✓ Float with scientific notation (1.23456789e-1)
✓ Zero and special values (0Ω, 0%, 0.000000001A)
✓ Frequency-dependent properties (esr_100hz, esr_1khz, etc.)
✓ Asymmetric tolerances (+80%/-20%)
✓ Block and inline pin formats
✓ Doc comments (##[...]) and block comments (#[...])
✓ Math expressions in comptime (i % 45, i / 45)
✓ Thermal pads and exposed pads
✓ High pin counts (up to 2048 pins)
]#

## BGA-64 - Basic 8x8 Ball Grid Array

component BGA_64_8x8:
    metadata:
        manufacturer: "Generic"
        package: "BGA-64"
        description: "8x8 Ball Grid Array with 0.8mm pitch"
        pin_count: "64"
        pitch: "0.8mm"
        body_size: "6mm x 6mm"
        notes: "Standard BGA package with circular solder balls 🔵"
    
    pins:
        A1, A2, A3, A4, A5, A6, A7, A8,
        B1, B2, B3, B4, B5, B6, B7, B8,
        C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7, C8,
        D1, D2, D3, D4, D5, D6, D7, D8,
        E1, E2, E3, E4, E5, E6, E7, E8,
        F1, F2, F3, F4, F5, F6, F7, F8,
        G1, G2, G3, G4, G5, G6, G7, G8,
        H1, H2, H3, H4, H5, H6, H7, H8
    
    layout:
        shape: Rectangle(6mm, 6mm, 1mm)
        pin_positions:
            A1 at [0.4mm, 0.4mm]
            A2 at [1.2mm, 0.4mm]
            A3 at [2.0mm, 0.4mm]
            A4 at [2.8mm, 0.4mm]
            A5 at [3.6mm, 0.4mm]
            A6 at [4.4mm, 0.4mm]
            A7 at [5.2mm, 0.4mm]
            A8 at [6.0mm, 0.4mm]
            B1 at [0.4mm, 1.2mm]
            B2 at [1.2mm, 1.2mm]
            B3 at [2.0mm, 1.2mm]
            B4 at [2.8mm, 1.2mm]
            B5 at [3.6mm, 1.2mm]
            B6 at [4.4mm, 1.2mm]
            B7 at [5.2mm, 1.2mm]
            B8 at [6.0mm, 1.2mm]
            C1 at [0.4mm, 2.0mm]
            C2 at [1.2mm, 2.0mm]
            C3 at [2.0mm, 2.0mm]
            C4 at [2.8mm, 2.0mm]
            C5 at [3.6mm, 2.0mm]
            C6 at [4.4mm, 2.0mm]
            C7 at [5.2mm, 2.0mm]
            C8 at [6.0mm, 2.0mm]
            D1 at [0.4mm, 2.8mm]
            D2 at [1.2mm, 2.8mm]
            D3 at [2.0mm, 2.8mm]
            D4 at [2.8mm, 2.8mm]
            D5 at [3.6mm, 2.8mm]
            D6 at [4.4mm, 2.8mm]
            D7 at [5.2mm, 2.8mm]
            D8 at [6.0mm, 2.8mm]
            E1 at [0.4mm, 3.6mm]
            E2 at [1.2mm, 3.6mm]
            E3 at [2.0mm, 3.6mm]
            E4 at [2.8mm, 3.6mm]
            E5 at [3.6mm, 3.6mm]
            E6 at [4.4mm, 3.6mm]
            E7 at [5.2mm, 3.6mm]
            E8 at [6.0mm, 3.6mm]
            F1 at [0.4mm, 4.4mm]
            F2 at [1.2mm, 4.4mm]
            F3 at [2.0mm, 4.4mm]
            F4 at [2.8mm, 4.4mm]
            F5 at [3.6mm, 4.4mm]
            F6 at [4.4mm, 4.4mm]
            F7 at [5.2mm, 4.4mm]
            F8 at [6.0mm, 4.4mm]
            G1 at [0.4mm, 5.2mm]
            G2 at [1.2mm, 5.2mm]
            G3 at [2.0mm, 5.2mm]
            G4 at [2.8mm, 5.2mm]
            G5 at [3.6mm, 5.2mm]
            G6 at [4.4mm, 5.2mm]
